/ Resume
%section#resume
  .content.dimmed-effect.padded-short
    .row
      .col-lg-4

        / Box - About Me
        .resume-box.animated.slide-in-top
          %i.title-icon.text-blue.flaticon-speech43

          %h3 Who am I?

          %p.lead Software makes everything new again.

          %p
            I'm inspired by technology. From the latest features on a phone to the leading edge of science in the
            cloud, no where else is there a world so full of possibilities.

          %p
            I work to bring out the best in my team; I ask questions, and try to teach what I know to others. I lead
            with interpersonal skills backed by substantial knowledge and experience. I’m a realist, and at the same
            time I drive for high ideals. I estimate and re-estimate honestly and deliver.

          %a.btn.btn-black( href="#portfolio" ) See my portfolio
          %a.btn.btn-default( href="#contact" ) Contact me

        / Box - Communication
        .resume-box.animated.slide-in-left.appear-second
          %i.title-icon.text-orange.flaticon-chat25

          %h3 Communication
          %p.lead The key to a successful software project

          %p
            I personally believe close communication allows me to deliver exactly the solution needed. It is a
            fine balance between getting input from a stakeholder and acting without autonomy. I leverage my
            10 years of software solution experience to make the judgement of when the technical decision is best
            made by developers, or when the business decision should be made by stakeholders.

      .col-md-6.col-lg-4

        / Box - Specialities
        .resume-box.animated.slide-in-right
          %i.title-icon.text-red.flaticon-mouse19

          %h3 My Specialities
          / Speciality
          .speciality
            %i.speciality-icon.text-red.flaticon-bulb11

            .speciality-content
              %h5.short Intellectual Property

              %p.speciality-description Building strong patent portfolios as I design real world solutions.

          / Speciality
          .speciality
            %i.speciality-icon.text-red.flaticon-codings1

            .speciality-content
              %h5.short End-to-End Development

              %p.speciality-description Database schema, API, HTML and Mobile app development.

          / Speciality
          .speciality
            %i.speciality-icon.text-red.flaticon-tablet42

            .speciality-content
              %h5.short Mobile First

              %p.speciality-description iOS, Android and Windows Phone experience.

        / Box - Education & Jobs
        .resume-box.animated.slide-in-left
          %i.title-icon.text-yellow.flaticon-document56

          %h3 Work History

          :ruby
            @work_history = [
              {
                event_date: 'Oct 2010 - Apr 2015',
                event_name: 'Microsoft Corporation',
                event_description: 'Redmond, WA'
              },
              {
                event_date: 'Feb 2009 - June 2010',
                event_name: 'Phoenix Media Communications Group',
                event_description: 'Boston, MA'
              },
              {
                event_date: 'Dec 2006 - Feb 2009',
                event_name: 'The NASDAQ OMX Group',
                event_description: 'Maynard, MA'
              }
            ]

          .timeline
            - @work_history.each do |event|
              / Single event
              .timeline-event.te-yellow
                .event-date= event[:event_date]
                .event-name= event[:event_name]
                .event-description= event[:event_description]


      .col-md-6.col-lg-4

        :ruby
          @skills = [
            { name: 'Microsoft Azure / C#', score: 4 },
            { name: 'Ruby on Rails / RSpec', score: 4 },
            { name: 'Security and Cryptography', score: 4 },
            { name: 'Objective-C / Swift / AppKit / UIKit', score: 3 },
            { name: 'HTML / CSS / JS', score: 3 },
            { name: 'Azure Table / MS-SQL / MySQL / MongoDB', score: 3 },
            { name: 'Java / Java Enterprise', score: 2},
            { name: 'C / C++ / C++ CLI / Intel & ARM Assembly', score: 2}
          ]

        / Box - Skills & Attributes
        .resume-box.animated.slide-in-right.appear-second
          %i.title-icon.text-green.flaticon-open79

          %h3 Technologies & Languages

          - @skills.each do |skill|
            / Single skill
            .skill
              %span.skill-name= skill[:name]

              .skill-bar.sb-green
                - skill[:score].times do
                  .skill-rate-on
                - (4 - skill[:score]).times do
                  .skill-rate-off


        / Box - Hobbies
        .resume-box.animated.slide-in-bottom
          %h3 Other

          :ruby
            @hobbies = [
              'Publishing Articles',
              'Starting Companies',
              'Working with GLBT youth',
              'Supporting ending methamphetamine addiction'
            ]

          / List group
          %ul.list-group
            - @hobbies.each do |hobby|
              %li.list-group-item= hobby